# THE DROPPER (improvement 3c; Brains `drop`, the tamper). It waits on a lip over
# lower ground and comes down on whoever is under it. Its tell is its SHADOW on
# the ground where it will land, growing to the size of the landing as it comes
# (FightRules.tell_drop, MobFx.tell_drop), with the body crouched and coiled on
# the lip and the drive in its face warming to the leap. Each frame is taken with
# the shadow up: from above, then over the shoulder, where a shadow on the ground
# is read the same way. On the crags' shelves, the lip is the nearest drop
# `Jump.find` names, and the tamper takes the player's place on it (`over`),
# never a coordinate.
# Run at a fixed rate, so a frame costs the world no time:
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/dropper.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=knife:1 --held=knife --config=unharmed
place the_crags
coast calm
zoom 8
wait 0.6
ledge down
wait 0.3
over tamper
await tell 8
wait 0.5
shot 01-its-shadow-grows-where-it-will-land with mob:tamper
# Down: the landing, where the shadow was.
wait 0.45
shot 02-down-where-the-shadow-was with mob:tamper

place the_crags
coast calm
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
ledge down
wait 0.3
over tamper
await tell 8
wait 0.5
shot 03-over-the-shoulder-the-shadow-reads-the-same with shoulder,mob:tamper
